OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for brandishing razor
OL,4,Aon train
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who brandished a cut-throat razor
OL,7,Fand threatened passengers on a
OL,8,FSoutheastern train bound for Dover
OL,9,FPriory has been jailed for two years.
OL,11,FWhile travelling on 3 April, Hogr Saeed
OL,12,Fwas observed becoming increasingly
OL,13,Fagitated before going on to produce the
OL,14,Fweapon and threatening to kill other
OL,15,Fpassengers, Kent Police said.
OL,17,FSaeed was arrested at around 21:00 BST
OL,18,Fthat day, charged with multiple
OL,19,Foffences, including threats to kill,
OL,20,Fpossession of an offensive weapon,
OL,21,Faffray and criminal damage.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
